# Introduced 2026-07-20 for the pilot deployment migration long-cell tolerance;
# default flipped True 2026-07-20 after validating on ExampleVendor_Txn_Budget.
# When True and a cell's verify fails with ConnectionDied (server closed WS
# after ~15 min idle-data-channel), don't burn the 5-attempt retry budget:
# mark the cell MIGRATED_NOT_VALIDATED and switch the task to code-only mode.
# The migrated code is still saved; runtime workflow execution on AIDP's
# task engine (not our WS) will run the cell for real.
