# Rationale for default-True: retries can't help — each retry hits the same
# server-side idle timeout (~15–30 min), wasting 1–2.5 hours per stuck cell
# before the cell is marked FAILED. Skip-and-mark preserves the migrated code,
# validates what's validatable, and lets the run continue.
#
# Toggle via CLI: --no-skip-cells-on-connection-died to opt out (default True).
# To revert entirely: remove this constant + the corresponding block in the
# verify-fail handler (search for the matching END marker).
